# Desktop: Practice 2048 on 4×4 from the title, a few slides by keys and a swipe, a hint, undo, the pause sheet, Leave; the title offers Resume.
# viewport 1280x720@1
until 300 =Play
frames 150
save title
click =Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Practice
until 60 Setup
frames 10
save modes
click =Start
until 120 Objective
frames 60
key ArrowLeft 1
frames 10
key ArrowUp 1
frames 10
key KeyD 1
frames 10
swipe 50% 40% 50% 70% 8
frames 30
key KeyH 1
frames 30
save play
key KeyZ 1
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 Paused
frames 10
save pause
click =Leave run
until 60 Resume run
frames 10
save resume
